{"id":"69750ae210519a25","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-zero-function.md","title":"Zero Function $Z$","display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function $Z$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-zero-function","aliases":["92-df-zero-function"],"display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function $Z$","depends_on":[],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-zero-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-zero-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-function — Zero Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zero-function-—-Zero-Functions-$Z_k$\">df-zero-function — Zero Functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k\">\\(Z_k\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},Z\">\\((Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},Z\\)</span> (definition-target zero functions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z_k\\coloneqq(\\vec n\\mapsto0):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\bigr),\\qquad Z\\coloneqq Z_1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z_k\\coloneqq(\\vec n\\mapsto0):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\bigr),\\qquad Z\\coloneqq Z_1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k\">\\(Z_k\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元零函数；惯用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是一元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_1\">\\(Z_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>零函数将任意输入元组映射到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span></li>\n<li>零函数是原始递归函数的基本函数之一</li>\n<li>在系统G中表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_Z(x, y) \\coloneqq y = 0\">\\(\\varphi_Z(x, y) \\coloneqq y = 0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\varphi_Z(\\bar{n}, \\overline{Z(n)})\">\\(G \\vdash \\varphi_Z(\\bar{n}, \\overline{Z(n)})\\)</span>即<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\overline{Z(n)} = 0\">\\(G \\vdash \\overline{Z(n)} = 0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zero-function-—-Zero-Functions-$Z_k$","text":"df-zero-function — Zero Functions $Z_k$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N},Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z_k\\coloneqq(\\vec n\\mapsto0):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\bigr),\\qquad Z\\coloneqq Z_1","display":true},{"tex":"Z_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z_1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_Z(x, y) \\coloneqq y = 0","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\varphi_Z(\\bar{n}, \\overline{Z(n)})","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\overline{Z(n)} = 0","display":false}],"bytes":1106,"backlinks":[{"id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}$ (zero functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]])"},{"id":"6fb25d603f77631d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"326ba319ed196f03","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,Z=Z_1$ (successor and unary zero functions, see [[92-df-successor-function]] and [[92-df-zero-function]])"},{"id":"9031faf8a1461cc3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z_1$ (unary zero function, see [[92-df-zero-function]])"},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z$ (zero function, see [[92-df-zero-function]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":[]}